{"capturado_en": "2026-11-11T23:56:49+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Eye, caramba!", "steam_appid": 1485900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5191460], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello! Your goal in this game is to arrange colored blocks in the right order to get a gradient. It is advised to play the levels in random order (using the designated button), because they aren't necessarily ordered by complexity, and it's just more fun this way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The colors don't only differ by hue (red, yellow, blue), but also by brightness (lighter, darker) and saturation (richer, paler). And the last two parameters will often be more useful than just the first one. Try to hover an unsolved block over solved ones to get a better idea of where it should go. All levels are logical, some are simpler, some are trickier, but all of them are solvable with common sense. Good luck!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello! Your goal in this game is to arrange colored blocks in the right order to get a gradient. It is advised to play the levels in random order (using the designated button), because they aren't necessarily ordered by complexity, and it's just more fun this way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The colors don't only differ by hue (red, yellow, blue), but also by brightness (lighter, darker) and saturation (richer, paler). And the last two parameters will often be more useful than just the first one. Try to hover an unsolved block over solved ones to get a better idea of where it should go. All levels are logical, some are simpler, some are trickier, but all of them are solvable with common sense. Good luck!</p>", "short_description": "Got a keen eye? Then try to solve these colorful soothing puzzles while listening to relaxing music!", "supported_languages": "English, Russian, French, Czech, Dutch, Greek, Indonesian, Korean, Romanian, Thai, Ukrainian, Belarusia